              "name": "promptText",
              "value": "=Produce a polished, commercial-grade marketing clip from the supplied product image. Mimic a gentle, lifelike 3D turntable spin so the product appears to rotate in place. The motion must be slow, fluid, and consistent—no abrupt moves, pans, or edits. Keep the full product in view at all times: centered, uncropped, and never zoomed. Aim for a sleek, modern, premium look suitable for advertising. Skip flashy effects, transitions, text, or overlays. The result should be a restrained, realistic rotation that showcases the product with maximum sophistication."
            },
